  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is driven by an engine delivering a constant power of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. the body starts from rest and moves in a straight line. After <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>,&nbsp;the body has moved a distance (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>)&hellip;.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "18",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Power delivered by the engine&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Mass of the body is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Body&nbsp;starts from&nbsp;the rest,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Using work energy Theorem,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Substitute the values in the above equation, we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>d</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>9</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
